{"id":"e7923f429b681274","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension.md","title":"二值 DNC 等价于全二值延伸性质","display":"thm-dnc2-binary-extension — 二值 DNC 等价于全二值延伸性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension","aliases":["20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension"],"display":"thm-dnc2-binary-extension — 二值 DNC 等价于全二值延伸性质","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3(iii)–(iv)","source_printed_pages":[185,186],"source_pdf_pages":[217,218],"depends_on":["[[20-df-binary-extension-property]]","[[20-df-dnc]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dnc2-binary-extension — 二值 DNC 等价于全二值延伸性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3(iii)–(iv)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span><span>186</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a668d5b21b39c67\" href=\"?note=4a668d5b21b39c67\" title=\"20-df-binary-extension-property\">20-df-binary-extension-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；见证函数均全定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a668d5b21b39c67\" href=\"?note=4a668d5b21b39c67\" title=\"20-df-binary-extension-property\">20-df-binary-extension-property</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc2-binary-extension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\le_T A\\ [\\operatorname{DNC}_2(g)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc2-binary-extension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\le_T A\\ [\\operatorname{DNC}_2(g)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给二值 DNC <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和部分二值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，s-m-n 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x)\">\\(q(x)\\)</span>，其程序在任何输入上模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(x)\">\\(\\psi(x)\\)</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{q(x)}(q(x))\\simeq\\psi(x)\">\\(\\varphi_{q(x)}(q(x))\\simeq\\psi(x)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=1-g(q(x))\">\\(f(x)=1-g(q(x))\\)</span>，已定义的二值输出必被保留。反向令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(e)\">\\(\\psi(e)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(e)\">\\(\\varphi_e(e)\\)</span> 停止且输出小于 2 时取其值，其余发散。取二值全延伸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(e)=1-f(e)\">\\(g(e)=1-f(e)\\)</span> 二值 DNC；对角输出不在 2 内时也自动不同。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3(iii)–(iv)；印刷页 185, 186；PDF 第 217, 218 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-binary-extension-property","status":"resolved","id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-binary-extension-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-binary-extension-property","status":"resolved","id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dnc2-binary-extension}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\le_T A\\ [\\operatorname{DNC}_2(g)].","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"q(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{q(x)}(q(x))\\simeq\\psi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)=1-g(q(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(e)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g(e)=1-f(e)","display":false}],"bytes":1490,"backlinks":[{"id":"26f419e80554b0b9","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa-degree]]；see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-thm-dnc2-special-class]]；see [[20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension]]；see [[20-thm-binary-extension-path]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":["4a668d5b21b39c67","d92408f78f418e97","8ba6597a854c206f"]}